00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:15.041
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:15.916 --> 00:01:17.500
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:21.416
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.791
When a future

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:27.125
You just waved to me.

00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:28.500
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:32.375
But you won't forget about this

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:37.500
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.041
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:43.375
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:45.625
When a future

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
You just waved to me.

00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:05.416
A Day We Love Best

00:02:25.541 --> 00:02:27.750
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.250
On this most celebrated day,

00:02:29.416 --> 00:02:31.625
we, the loving friends and family of

00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:37.000
our dearest Lady Zhu have gathered to celebrate her birthday.

00:02:37.291 --> 00:02:39.250
Before we get this gala going, allow me to introduce myself.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.916
Inviting you was difficult.

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:33.125
The Don doesn't like the Rat King's monopoly on this medicine.

00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:36.166
Why don't you help us make this medicine too?

00:03:38.916 --> 00:03:40.125
This is none of my business!

00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:41.500
HELP!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.125
Sorry for the wait. Up next, let's welcome Lady Zhu

00:03:57.125 --> 00:03:59.166
with a big round of applause!

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:04.500
Thank you all for coming!

00:04:04.916 --> 00:04:09.250
Now, please enjoy the performances that we have prepared for you.

00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:23.375
Take him away.

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:43.958
Did you see their boss?

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:45.375
No.

00:04:54.916 --> 00:04:55.791
Did you see Aak?

00:04:56.541 --> 00:04:57.041
I dunno.

00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:02.916
We should watch a play together next time!

00:05:06.041 --> 00:05:06.625
Sure!

00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:31.125
Is this the place?

00:05:31.625 --> 00:05:33.375
Aak? Where are you?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.250
We finally meet.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:40.541
Rat King.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.000
How are you doing?

00:05:43.625 --> 00:05:48.416
Feels good to have everyone in your pockets, doesn't it?

00:05:49.041 --> 00:05:52.250
You have every Lungmen gang working for you.

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:56.250
Then you tie us down with unreasonable work!

00:05:58.666 --> 00:06:01.666
I've been watching you for a while.

00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:04.916
I shall end your existence today!

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:17.875
Hand over Aak to us!

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.666
Rat King.

00:06:26.416 --> 00:06:29.000
Not everyone gets to see the real Rat King!

00:06:31.625 --> 00:06:32.041
WHAT?!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.000
You took the bait,

00:06:34.416 --> 00:06:35.750
dimwit.

00:06:37.291 --> 00:06:39.500
Let's catch the cat.

00:06:40.875 --> 00:06:42.000
Must we speak in four words now?

00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:43.875
Hot is this bodybag.

00:06:43.875 --> 00:06:44.625
Jeeze, quit it.

00:06:45.041 --> 00:06:46.750
What a lousy plan!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:47.625
You *LUNGMEN* *EXPLETIVE*

00:07:11.625 --> 00:07:13.000
Ji-ji-ru-lu-ling!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.666
SAVE MEEEEE!!!

00:07:24.416 --> 00:07:26.416
I didn't expect this disguise.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.375
What Cat Mafia?

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.750
He's not even a cat.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:19.875
Don Felino is still at large.

00:08:25.875 --> 00:08:28.000
Nonetheless, we still carried out your task.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:29.750
It's alright.

00:08:30.625 --> 00:08:32.750
We revealed his true form.

00:08:33.125 --> 00:08:36.000
The fake Cat Mafia is no more.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.416
How fares the young man?

00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:06.041
I QUIT! This job is too tiring for me!

00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:09.000
We can go start a restaurant!

00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:13.291
Just get some sleep. We'll make more money tomorrow.

00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:17.000
I'M LEAVING LUNGMEN TOMORROW!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:52.125
Long-term request: The Rat King wanted Lee's D.A

00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:55.500
to find out more about the Cat Mafia's Don. 

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.333
If this Don is a fraud, then reveal his true identity 

00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:03.500
and take down his fake organization.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:08.458
(See you again)

